<!-- ═══ 인플루언서 ═══ -->
<div class="panel active" id="panel-influencers">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="actions-bar">
      <div class="card-title">인플루언서 목록 <span class="count" id="influencerCount">0</span></div>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" onclick="addInfluencerRow()">+ 행 추가</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="saveInfluencers()">저장</button>
        <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="clearInfluencers()">전체 삭제</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="paste-area" id="pasteArea" contenteditable="false" tabindex="0">
      <p>구글 시트에서 복사 후 여기를 클릭하고 Ctrl+V</p>
      <small>닉네임 &nbsp; | &nbsp; 인포크 URL &nbsp; | &nbsp; 제품명 &nbsp; (탭으로 구분)</small>
    </div>

    <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th style="width:50px">No</th>
            <th>닉네임</th>
            <th>인포크 URL</th>
            <th>제품명</th>
            <th style="width:60px"></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="influencersBody"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
